  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade mission to Benin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands continues to support initiatives to improve sustainable trade and investment in Benin, while at the same time trying to attract Dutch investors and companies to stimulate bilateral trade and take a role in capacity strengthening of Beninese private sector.As part of the set of initiatives, a trade mission to Benin is organised. The purpose of the mission is to contribute to the economic development of Benin and to strengthen trade with the Netherlands. The specific objective of the mission is to promote business relations between the Dutch companies participating in this trade mission and the economic operators of Benin evolving or interested in the targeted subsectors.</narrative>
  </description>
